{
  "book": "2nephi",
  "bookName": "2 Nephi",
  "chapter": 20,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 348.233,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.111,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wo unto them that decree unrighteous decrees,",
      "verse": "20:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 3.291,
      "end": 6.681,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that write grievousness which they have prescribed;",
      "verse": "20:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 7.361,
      "end": 9.869,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "To turn away the needy from judgment,",
      "verse": "20:2",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 10.049,
      "end": 13.578,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and to take away the right from the poor of my people,",
      "verse": "20:2",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 13.758,
      "end": 15.801,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that widows may be their prey,",
      "verse": "20:2",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 15.981,
      "end": 18.582,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that they may rob the fatherless!",
      "verse": "20:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 19.262,
      "end": 22.048,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And what will ye do in the day of visitation,",
      "verse": "20:3",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 22.228,
      "end": 25.479,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and in the desolation which shall come from far?",
      "verse": "20:3",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 25.659,
      "end": 27.609,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to whom will ye flee for help?",
      "verse": "20:3",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 27.789,
      "end": 29.739,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and where will ye leave your glory?",
      "verse": "20:3",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 30.419,
      "end": 33.856,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Without me they shall bow down under the prisoners,",
      "verse": "20:4",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 34.036,
      "end": 36.451,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they shall fall under the slain.",
      "verse": "20:4",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 36.631,
      "end": 39.046,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For all this his anger is not turned away,",
      "verse": "20:4",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 39.226,
      "end": 41.594,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but his hand is stretched out still.",
      "verse": "20:4",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 42.274,
      "end": 44.642,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O Assyrian, the rod of mine anger,",
      "verse": "20:5",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 44.822,
      "end": 48.398,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the staff in their hand is their indignation.",
      "verse": "20:5",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 49.078,
      "end": 52.143,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I will send him against a hypocritical nation,",
      "verse": "20:6",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 52.323,
      "end": 56.085,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and against the people of my wrath will I give him a charge to take the spoil,",
      "verse": "20:6",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 56.265,
      "end": 57.798,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and to take the prey,",
      "verse": "20:6",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 57.978,
      "end": 60.857,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and to tread them down like the mire of the streets.",
      "verse": "20:6",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 61.537,
      "end": 63.441,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Howbeit he meaneth not so,",
      "verse": "20:7",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 63.621,
      "end": 65.757,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither doth his heart think so;",
      "verse": "20:7",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 65.937,
      "end": 71.185,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but in his heart it is to destroy and cut off nations not a few.",
      "verse": "20:7",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 71.865,
      "end": 73.305,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For he saith:",
      "verse": "20:8",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 73.485,
      "end": 76.086,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Are not my princes altogether kings?",
      "verse": "20:8",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 76.766,
      "end": 78.624,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Is not Calno as Carchemish?",
      "verse": "20:9",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 78.804,
      "end": 80.662,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Is not Hamath as Arpad?",
      "verse": "20:9",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 80.842,
      "end": 82.839,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Is not Samaria as Damascus?",
      "verse": "20:9",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 83.519,
      "end": 86.491,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "As my hand hath founded the kingdoms of the idols,",
      "verse": "20:10",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 86.671,
      "end": 91.687,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and whose graven images did excel them of Jerusalem and of Samaria;",
      "verse": "20:10",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 92.367,
      "end": 93.714,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Shall I not,",
      "verse": "20:11",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 93.894,
      "end": 96.82,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "as I have done unto Samaria and her idols,",
      "verse": "20:11",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 97.0,
      "end": 99.647,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "so do to Jerusalem and to her idols?",
      "verse": "20:11",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 100.327,
      "end": 102.324,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore it shall come to pass",
      "verse": "20:12",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 102.504,
      "end": 107.055,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "when the Lord hath performed his whole work upon Mount Zion and upon Jerusalem,",
      "verse": "20:12",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 107.235,
      "end": 110.95,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I will punish the fruit of the stout heart of the king of Assyria,",
      "verse": "20:12",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 111.13,
      "end": 113.173,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the glory of his high looks.",
      "verse": "20:12",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 113.853,
      "end": 116.779,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For he saith: By the strength of my hand",
      "verse": "20:13",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 116.959,
      "end": 118.584,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and by my wisdom",
      "verse": "20:13",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 118.764,
      "end": 120.714,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I have done these things;",
      "verse": "20:13",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 120.894,
      "end": 122.473,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for I am prudent;",
      "verse": "20:13",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 122.653,
      "end": 125.114,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I have moved the borders of the people",
      "verse": "20:13",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 125.294,
      "end": 127.198,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and have robbed their treasures,",
      "verse": "20:13",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 127.378,
      "end": 131.0,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I have put down the inhabitants like a valiant man;",
      "verse": "20:13",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 131.68,
      "end": 135.395,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And my hand hath found as a nest the riches of the people;",
      "verse": "20:14",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 135.575,
      "end": 138.408,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and as one gathereth eggs that are left",
      "verse": "20:14",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 138.588,
      "end": 140.724,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "have I gathered all the earth;",
      "verse": "20:14",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 140.904,
      "end": 143.04,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and there was none that moved the wing,",
      "verse": "20:14",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 143.22,
      "end": 144.845,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or opened the mouth,",
      "verse": "20:14",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 145.025,
      "end": 146.093,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or peeped.",
      "verse": "20:14",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 146.773,
      "end": 150.581,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Shall the ax boast itself against him that heweth therewith?",
      "verse": "20:15",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 150.761,
      "end": 154.383,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Shall the saw magnify itself against him that shaketh it?",
      "verse": "20:15",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 154.563,
      "end": 158.139,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "As if the rod should shake itself against them that lift it up,",
      "verse": "20:15",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 158.319,
      "end": 161.059,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or as if the staff should lift up itself",
      "verse": "20:15",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 161.239,
      "end": 162.957,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "as if it were no wood!",
      "verse": "20:15",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 163.637,
      "end": 168.699,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore shall the Lord, the Lord of Hosts, send among his fat ones, leanness;",
      "verse": "20:16",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 168.879,
      "end": 170.69,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and under his glory",
      "verse": "20:16",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 170.87,
      "end": 174.353,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he shall kindle a burning like the burning of a fire.",
      "verse": "20:16",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 175.033,
      "end": 178.191,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the light of Israel shall be for a fire,",
      "verse": "20:17",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 178.371,
      "end": 180.461,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and his Holy One for a flame,",
      "verse": "20:17",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 180.641,
      "end": 183.706,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and shall burn and shall devour his thorns",
      "verse": "20:17",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 183.886,
      "end": 185.697,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and his briers in one day;",
      "verse": "20:17",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 186.377,
      "end": 189.071,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And shall consume the glory of his forest,",
      "verse": "20:18",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 189.251,
      "end": 191.062,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and of his fruitful field,",
      "verse": "20:18",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 191.242,
      "end": 192.775,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "both soul and body;",
      "verse": "20:18",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 192.955,
      "end": 196.345,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they shall be as when a standard-bearer fainteth.",
      "verse": "20:18",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 197.025,
      "end": 200.09,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the rest of the trees of his forest shall be few,",
      "verse": "20:19",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 200.27,
      "end": 202.22,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that a child may write them.",
      "verse": "20:19",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 202.9,
      "end": 205.361,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it shall come to pass in that day,",
      "verse": "20:20",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 205.541,
      "end": 210.278,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the remnant of Israel, and such as are escaped of the house of Jacob,",
      "verse": "20:20",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 210.458,
      "end": 213.709,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "shall no more again stay upon him that smote them,",
      "verse": "20:20",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 213.889,
      "end": 218.161,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but shall stay upon the Lord, the Holy One of Israel, in truth.",
      "verse": "20:20",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 218.841,
      "end": 223.949,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "The remnant shall return, yea, even the remnant of Jacob, unto the mighty God.",
      "verse": "20:21",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 224.629,
      "end": 228.019,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For though thy people Israel be as the sand of the sea,",
      "verse": "20:22",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 228.199,
      "end": 230.614,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yet a remnant of them shall return;",
      "verse": "20:22",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 230.794,
      "end": 234.509,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the consumption decreed shall overflow with righteousness.",
      "verse": "20:22",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 235.189,
      "end": 238.672,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For the Lord God of Hosts shall make a consumption,",
      "verse": "20:23",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 238.852,
      "end": 241.081,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even determined in all the land.",
      "verse": "20:23",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 241.761,
      "end": 245.012,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore, thus saith the Lord God of Hosts:",
      "verse": "20:24",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 245.192,
      "end": 247.653,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O my people that dwellest in Zion,",
      "verse": "20:24",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 247.833,
      "end": 249.644,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "be not afraid of the Assyrian;",
      "verse": "20:24",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 249.824,
      "end": 252.146,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he shall smite thee with a rod,",
      "verse": "20:24",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 252.326,
      "end": 256.924,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and shall lift up his staff against thee, after the manner of Egypt.",
      "verse": "20:24",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 257.604,
      "end": 259.647,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For yet a very little while,",
      "verse": "20:25",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 259.827,
      "end": 261.87,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the indignation shall cease,",
      "verse": "20:25",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 262.05,
      "end": 264.558,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and mine anger in their destruction.",
      "verse": "20:25",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 265.238,
      "end": 271.972,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the Lord of Hosts shall stir up a scourge for him according to the slaughter of Midian at the rock of Oreb;",
      "verse": "20:26",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 272.152,
      "end": 274.381,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and as his rod was upon the sea",
      "verse": "20:26",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 274.561,
      "end": 277.672,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "so shall he lift it up after the manner of Egypt.",
      "verse": "20:26",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 278.352,
      "end": 280.674,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it shall come to pass in that day",
      "verse": "20:27",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 280.854,
      "end": 285.126,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that his burden shall be taken away from off thy shoulder,",
      "verse": "20:27",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 285.306,
      "end": 287.256,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and his yoke from off thy neck,",
      "verse": "20:27",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 287.436,
      "end": 291.058,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the yoke shall be destroyed because of the anointing.",
      "verse": "20:27",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 291.738,
      "end": 293.363,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "He is come to Aiath,",
      "verse": "20:28",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 293.543,
      "end": 295.215,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he is passed to Migron;",
      "verse": "20:28",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 295.395,
      "end": 297.856,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "at Michmash he hath laid up his carriages.",
      "verse": "20:28",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 298.536,
      "end": 300.812,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "They are gone over the passage;",
      "verse": "20:29",
      "lineIndex": 101
    },
    {
      "start": 300.992,
      "end": 303.593,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they have taken up their lodging at Geba;",
      "verse": "20:29",
      "lineIndex": 102
    },
    {
      "start": 303.773,
      "end": 305.398,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Ramath is afraid;",
      "verse": "20:29",
      "lineIndex": 103
    },
    {
      "start": 305.578,
      "end": 307.296,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Gibeah of Saul is fled.",
      "verse": "20:29",
      "lineIndex": 104
    },
    {
      "start": 307.976,
      "end": 309.416,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Lift up the voice,",
      "verse": "20:30",
      "lineIndex": 105
    },
    {
      "start": 309.596,
      "end": 311.175,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O daughter of Gallim;",
      "verse": "20:30",
      "lineIndex": 106
    },
    {
      "start": 311.355,
      "end": 313.909,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "cause it to be heard unto Laish,",
      "verse": "20:30",
      "lineIndex": 107
    },
    {
      "start": 314.089,
      "end": 315.807,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O poor Anathoth.",
      "verse": "20:30",
      "lineIndex": 108
    },
    {
      "start": 316.487,
      "end": 318.159,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Madmenah is removed;",
      "verse": "20:31",
      "lineIndex": 109
    },
    {
      "start": 318.339,
      "end": 321.45,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the inhabitants of Gebim gather themselves to flee.",
      "verse": "20:31",
      "lineIndex": 110
    },
    {
      "start": 322.13,
      "end": 324.963,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "As yet shall he remain at Nob that day;",
      "verse": "20:32",
      "lineIndex": 111
    },
    {
      "start": 325.143,
      "end": 328.998,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he shall shake his hand against the mount of the daughter of Zion,",
      "verse": "20:32",
